                Designing Structure for a Content-Heavy Safari Experience
            </h2>
            <div class="section__wrapper">
                <div class="row pin__sticky --reverse">
                    <div class="col minor">
                        <h3>Site Architecture & Navigation</h3>
                        <p>
                            Africa Dream Safaris offers a large volume of content across safari types, regions, travel guidance, and planning resources. The website needed a clearer structure to help visitors understand their safari options before booking.
                        </p>
                        <p>
                            We worked closely with the Africa Dream Safaris team to reorganize the site from the ground up, using sitemaps and wireframes to rethink navigation, page groupings, and dropdown structure. Informational content was consolidated into clear categories like “Our Safaris” and “Resources”, creating a more intuitive flow through the site. Throughout the process, we built credibility into key moments with awards, testimonials, and real-world proof, supporting confident decision-making for a once-in-a-lifetime trip.
                        </p>
