                        <h3>Custom WordPress CMS & Flexible Development</h3>
                        <p>
                            The site was developed using a custom WordPress CMS designed to support a large volume of structured content. We built a centralized content library to house regions, lodges, and related information, making it easy to manage and reuse content across the site.
                        </p>
                        <p>
                            On the backend, we prioritized flexibility without adding complexity. Editors can adjust visual options such as light or dark navigation themes, choose between higher- or lower-impact headers, and select between hosted video files or YouTube embeds based on the needs of each page. Site performance was considered throughout development, keeping page loads fast even with a large amount of content.
                        </p>
